{"text":"things like inflation, the debt burden, Dutch disease, this whole idea of dumping in billions of dollars and causing a strengthening of our domestic currencies, which kills off the export sector. These are problems that are not Dambisa Moyo cooked in her kitchen. They're very well established in the literature of development. In fact, the IMF look at the IMF literature itself. You will see that a lot of this discussion about the problems of aid is pretty well documented. Things like civil war has been written about the fact that the fact that money pools at the state level and you end up with all these factions, people always constantly trying to get rid of the government because there's no other source of capital. We don't have big private sectors. It should come as no surprise to many people in this room that Africa this year has had four coups already, four overthrows of government, coup d'états, my parents said to me recently, I said, yeah, can you imagine they've been four coups this year? They said, Dambisa, it's only November. They just wait.","words":[{"text":"things","start":0.0,"end":0.48},{"text":"like","start":0.48,"end":0.66},{"text":"inflation","start":0.66,"end":1.3,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":1.82,"end":1.88},{"text":"debt","start":1.88,"end":2.12},{"text":"burden","start":2.12,"end":2.62,"punct":","},{"text":"Dutch","start":3.12,"end":3.22},{"text":"disease","start":3.22,"end":3.7,"punct":","},{"text":"this","start":3.94,"end":4.02},{"text":"whole","start":4.02,"end":4.26},{"text":"idea","start":4.26,"end":4.58},{"text":"of","start":4.58,"end":4.88},{"text":"dumping","start":4.88,"end":5.22},{"text":"in","start":5.22,"end":5.46},{"text":"billions","start":5.46,"end":6.0},{"text":"of","start":6.0,"end":6.34},{"text":"dollars","start":6.34,"end":6.68},{"text":"and","start":6.68,"end":7.3},{"text":"causing","start":7.3,"end":8.02},{"text":"a","start":8.02,"end":8.3},{"text":"strengthening","start":8.3,"end":8.8},{"text":"of","start":8.8